  "duration_s": 603.392993,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "朱军，你知道吗？全世界最大的城市就在我们中国，它既做过中国的首都，还做过韩国首都。它相当于五个北京、十三个上海，四十一个深圳那么大，他是全中国游客最多的旅游城市。但你知道为什么它的防空洞火锅不让日本人进吗？今天挑战一口气，带你走进山城重庆，致敬江湖儿女三峡好人，你知道吗？我在美国参观联合国总部的时候，发现世界地图上中国只标注了四个城市。除了北京、上海、香港只有重庆，这重庆二十多年，经济翻了整整十二倍，是地球上发展速度最快的城市之一。但是中国有钱的城市多了，深圳、杭州哪个不富啊？那为什么联合国偏偏这么重视重庆，把它单独标注出来的那是因为在抗战期间，日本能够占领大半个中国，却唯独打不到重庆。那时，重庆作为战时首都，承受日军长达六年十个多月的疯狂轰炸，九千多架飞机，上万枚炸弹，三万两千八百二十九名同胞的生命。日本甚至还进行了精密计算，一颗导弹，能够炸死五点五个重庆人。但是山城人民应是挺直腰杆。不投降，徒手挖出了一千八百多个防空洞，上面顶着日寇的轰炸，下面日夜不停的拼命生产铲出了。抗战时期，全国百分之八十以上的军工品、爱国实业家卢作福赌上全部身家，带领民生公司所有船只和员工从水路抢运物资只用了四十天，就将二十万吨的物资搬运到重庆。连美国总统罗斯福都说，重庆和华盛顿、莫斯科、伦敦一样，是世界反法西斯的四大指挥中枢。一九四五年联合国成立的时候，重庆就成为中国提交了四座代表城市之一。朱军，你看我身后的重庆山多吧。二十世纪初，美国学者费正清从飞机俯瞰重庆时说，此地并不适合人类居住，因为没有平坦的陆地。重庆的山地丘陵比例高达百分之九十三点六。然而，现在重庆却变成了世界人口最多的城市，据说还是全国美女最多的城市。重庆人口三千两百多万，是我国唯一超三千万的超大城市。一九九七年，重庆成为了中国中西部唯一的直辖市，是全中国最大、最年轻的直辖市。重庆到底有多强？ Gdp全国第四，全国四十一个工业大类，重庆占了三十九个汽车产量，摩托车产量都是全国第一，重庆还是全球最大的笔记本电脑生产基地。如今，中国最反骨的城市，重庆赶称第二，没人敢称第一。你看这是重庆的波浪路，这是重庆的一楼，实际上你是在二十二楼重庆市国际公认的基建天花板，八d魔幻立交楼里跑轻轨。这里全国最深的地铁站红岩村站深埋一百一十六米，堪比四十层高楼。重庆是全中国桥梁最多的地方，有各类桥梁一点四万多座，跨江特大桥一百零五座，数量全国第一。重庆拥有五座机场，是我国民航机场数量最多的城市，这也是唯一一个国外比国内更火爆的城市。老外们都说，重庆是人生必须打卡的赛博朋克之城。我在重庆的机场发现外国人真的比中国人还要多，你能想象吗？在一九三八年，韩国流亡政府到重庆，建立了他们的临时首都，连韩国光复军的成立典礼都是在重庆举行的。所以每一年清明节都会有大量的韩国人到重庆的名玉真墓来祭祖。因为在历史上，闵玉珍在重庆建立了大夏国，后来大夏国归降于朱元璋，而明玉珍那些后人则被贬到了高丽国。也就是说，现在很多韩国人其实都是明玉珍的后代。周军都知道韩国人吃不起的西瓜太贵，但是我在重庆的西南大学遇见了一位九十七岁的老奶奶，他让中国人实现了吃瓜自由。他培育出了八四二四麒麟瓜皇后、哈密瓜、绿宝石瓜等等，他就是无名著院士，他是袁隆平的同学，中国西瓜之母，但他却因为阿尔兹海默症，忘记了亲人的名字，忘记了自己一生伟大的贡献。这里是全中国最大的抗日空军阵亡将士实葬墓地。他们是中国最壮烈的一群富二代，诠是帅气的世家子弟，牺牲时平均年龄仅仅二十三岁，一生最灿烂的年华。他们是中国第一代飞行员。从毕业到牺牲，只有半年，这里安眠着驾机撞上敌机同归于尽的陈怀民，放弃跳伞，驾机直撞日寇军舰的沈崇慧，连日本人都敬佩的闫海文。牺牲前，他嘶吼着，中国没有被俘空军。在重庆，你可以看到一串很特殊的地名，分别称之为四公里、五公里、七公里、八公里、九公里等等。当年抗战时期，民国政府不得不内迁重庆。后来，日本宣布封锁中国沿海，阻止一切圆华物资进入中国。就在这生死存亡的关键时刻，当务之急必须修建一条。通往外界的公路以够大后方的军事补给，于是便开始修建滇缅公路物资。从滇缅运往昆明之后，过贵州二十四拐抵达贵阳，再走川黔公路，它的终点就是重庆的海棠新码头。在源源不断的送往抗战前线，九公里八公里、六公里三公里，不只是地名，更是物资抵达终点的倒计时。朱军重庆是一座英雄的城市，重庆人民是英雄的人民。我的爷爷当年在抗美援朝的战友，邱少云就是重庆人。在抗战烽火中，中国一大批的文人学者逆行奔赴重庆。老舍先生在这里创作四世同堂。梁实修创作雅社小品矛盾在这里写下，白杨李赞还有文理大师、顾玉秀、地质学家、李四光、国歌的词作者、田汉等等，都在重庆投身抗战文艺，号召全民族抗日救亡。当时，全中国的政治、军事、经济、文化中心都搬到了重庆，一座山城，愣是成为了中国的诺亚方舟。而今天的重庆，更是一座把人文关怀做到极致的城市。重庆四号线连接着城区和郊区，每天清晨都有许多老人背着背篓进城卖菜。曾经有网友建议，高峰时段应该禁止乘客携带背篓，影响市容。但重庆官方霸气回应，我们的地铁容得下公文包，也容得下飞龙。考虑到不少老人听不懂普通话这条线，还特意增设了方言爆站。如今在重庆的长江上，还有一条亏本了，十几年的船只，乘客全是背着背篓的卖菜老人。大多数老人不会使用微信，还在保持着原始的手撕票据的方式。航线在长江上，经过六个站点，十多年，从未涨价，还有免费的早餐，时代的发展并没有把他们落下。周军在重庆，我见过一座最令人泪目的博物馆、三峡水下博物馆。这里收藏的不是冰冷的器物，而是三峡人民再也回不去的故乡。你见过这位在背上背了一整棵桃花树的男人吗？当年，他被告知要立刻搬离故乡，永远不可能再回来。他搬走全部家当之后，驮起了一棵正在盛放的桃树，最后一次带走故乡的春天。而他的家乡不久之后，将被江水彻底吞没。这就是二十世纪最伟大的工程，背后一个平凡的不能再平凡的故事。二零零二年，感动中国人物把一座特别的奖杯颁给了，一百三十多万。像他一样背着桃花树离乡的人，他们共同的身份叫三峡一民无数。重庆、湖北儿女离开了生于丝，长于司的故土。而现在，全中国最敢花钱消费的城市在哪里？答案可能出乎你的意料，不是北上广深，而是重庆二零二五年。社会消费品零售数据，重庆直接干掉上海，登顶全国第一。重庆一年就要吃掉一百二十亿吨火锅，每天要吃掉五百万碗小面。如果说北上广深是中国经济的排头兵，那么川渝地区就是中国城市的幸福样板。今天的重庆五a级景区有十二个有着世界自然遗产天坑地缝，世界上著名的长江三峡，世界上最大规模的磨牙石刻大足石刻，全球三大溶洞之一的芙蓉洞，还有现实版的千与千寻、洪崖洞，它又是世界温泉之都世界六大雾都之一，更是世界上最宠粉的城市。尽管年平均雾日多达一百零四天，但无数人都坦言，离开重庆，就像一场猝不及防的失恋，满心都是牵挂。长江与嘉陵江再次交汇，滋养出一座山水相依的魅力之城。这里是红岩精神的孕育之地，也是巴渝文化的发祥地。每当夜幕降临，洪崖洞亮灯的瞬间，灯火璀璨。凤姐与巫山交界处的瞿塘峡，是三峡中最短却最雄奇的一段两岸苍山被长江劈开，形成天造地设的夔门，这就是十元钱人民币背面的图案。三国时期，刘备托孤诸葛亮的故事就发生在白帝城。朝辞白帝彩云间，千里江陵一日还。来重庆，一定要现场感受一下，轻舟已过万重山，感受大自然鬼斧神工的震撼。而在重庆的大山深处，还有一颗三千多岁的金丝楠木王。更神奇的是，他还是一颗雷击木，被大火烧之后，竟然枯木逢春，被当地村民称之为长生树。据说能够看上一眼，都是有福之人。朱君，总有一天，你会来到心里一直惦记的魔幻山城。重庆走在高低错落的梯坎路上，吹着长江与嘉陵江交织的晚风，看蜀之道，立于群山之上，看纵横交错的大桥立交，看穿梭于西峰古道的棒棒君。重庆的重是重逢。重庆的庆是庆幸诚邀诸君共赴山城，在江枫与烟火中读懂这座成的万千风情。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00001",
      "start_ms": 370,
      "end_ms": 750,
      "text": "朱军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1110,
      "end_ms": 1810,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2090,
      "end_ms": 4810,
      "text": "全世界最大的城市就在我们中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00004",
      "start_ms": 5230,
      "end_ms": 6730,
      "text": "它既做过中国的首都，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00005",
      "start_ms": 6830,
      "end_ms": 8289,
      "text": "还做过韩国首都。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00006",
      "start_ms": 8550,
      "end_ms": 10990,
      "text": "它相当于五个北京、十三个上海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00007",
      "start_ms": 10990,
      "end_ms": 12310,
      "text": "四十一个深圳那么大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00008",
      "start_ms": 12810,
      "end_ms": 15290,
      "text": "他是全中国游客最多的旅游城市。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00009",
      "start_ms": 15430,
      "end_ms": 18630,
      "text": "但你知道为什么它的防空洞火锅不让日本人进吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00010",
      "start_ms": 19010,
      "end_ms": 20310,
      "text": "今天挑战一口气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00011",
      "start_ms": 20310,
      "end_ms": 22270,
      "text": "带你走进山城重庆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00012",
      "start_ms": 22670,
      "end_ms": 25270,
      "text": "致敬江湖儿女三峡好人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00013",
      "start_ms": 25710,
      "end_ms": 26410,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00014",
      "start_ms": 26430,
      "end_ms": 28710,
      "text": "我在美国参观联合国总部的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00015",
      "start_ms": 28710,
      "end_ms": 32000,
      "text": "发现世界地图上中国只标注了四个城市。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00016",
      "start_ms": 32240,
      "end_ms": 35060,
      "text": "除了北京、上海、香港只有重庆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00017",
      "start_ms": 35420,
      "end_ms": 36780,
      "text": "这重庆二十多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00018",
      "start_ms": 36780,
      "end_ms": 38420,
      "text": "经济翻了整整十二倍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00019",
      "start_ms": 38460,
      "end_ms": 40920,
      "text": "是地球上发展速度最快的城市之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00020",
      "start_ms": 41080,
      "end_ms": 43200,
      "text": "但是中国有钱的城市多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00021",
      "start_ms": 43380,
      "end_ms": 45240,
      "text": "深圳、杭州哪个不富啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00022",
      "start_ms": 45320,
      "end_ms": 47640,
      "text": "那为什么联合国偏偏这么重视重庆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00023",
      "start_ms": 47800,
      "end_ms": 51180,
      "text": "把它单独标注出来的那是因为在抗战期间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00024",
      "start_ms": 51180,
      "end_ms": 52960,
      "text": "日本能够占领大半个中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00025",
      "start_ms": 52960,
      "end_ms": 54640,
      "text": "却唯独打不到重庆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00026",
      "start_ms": 55000,
      "end_ms": 55380,
      "text": "那时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00027",
      "start_ms": 55380,
      "end_ms": 56920,
      "text": "重庆作为战时首都，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00028",
      "start_ms": 57020,
      "end_ms": 60110,
      "text": "承受日军长达六年十个多月的疯狂轰炸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00029",
      "start_ms": 60660,
      "end_ms": 61820,
      "text": "九千多架飞机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00030",
      "start_ms": 61820,
      "end_ms": 62860,
      "text": "上万枚炸弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00031",
      "start_ms": 62980,
      "end_ms": 65725,
      "text": "三万两千八百二十九名同胞的生命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00032",
      "start_ms": 65990,
      "end_ms": 67650,
      "text": "日本甚至还进行了精密计算，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00033",
      "start_ms": 67790,
      "end_ms": 68470,
      "text": "一颗导弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00034",
      "start_ms": 68490,
      "end_ms": 70335,
      "text": "能够炸死五点五个重庆人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00035",
      "start_ms": 70780,
      "end_ms": 73560,
      "text": "但是山城人民应是挺直腰杆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00036",
      "start_ms": 73560,
      "end_ms": 74100,
      "text": "不投降，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00037",
      "start_ms": 74220,
      "end_ms": 76360,
      "text": "徒手挖出了一千八百多个防空洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00038",
      "start_ms": 76640,
      "end_ms": 78080,
      "text": "上面顶着日寇的轰炸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00039",
      "start_ms": 78160,
      "end_ms": 80740,
      "text": "下面日夜不停的拼命生产铲出了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00040",
      "start_ms": 80740,
      "end_ms": 81480,
      "text": "抗战时期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00041",
      "start_ms": 81480,
      "end_ms": 86420,
      "text": "全国百分之八十以上的军工品、爱国实业家卢作福赌上全部身家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00042",
      "start_ms": 86600,
      "end_ms": 91850,
      "text": "带领民生公司所有船只和员工从水路抢运物资只用了四十天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00043",
      "start_ms": 91990,
      "end_ms": 94755,
      "text": "就将二十万吨的物资搬运到重庆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00044",
      "start_ms": 95310,
      "end_ms": 96930,
      "text": "连美国总统罗斯福都说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00045",
      "start_ms": 97130,
      "end_ms": 99710,
      "text": "重庆和华盛顿、莫斯科、伦敦一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00046",
      "start_ms": 99770,
      "end_ms": 102535,
      "text": "是世界反法西斯的四大指挥中枢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00047",
      "start_ms": 103050,
      "end_ms": 104910,
      "text": "一九四五年联合国成立的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00048",
      "start_ms": 104930,
      "end_ms": 108075,
      "text": "重庆就成为中国提交了四座代表城市之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00049",
      "start_ms": 108500,
      "end_ms": 108900,
      "text": "朱军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00050",
      "start_ms": 108980,
      "end_ms": 110905,
      "text": "你看我身后的重庆山多吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00051",
      "start_ms": 111300,
      "end_ms": 112240,
      "text": "二十世纪初，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00052",
      "start_ms": 112240,
      "end_ms": 115124,
      "text": "美国学者费正清从飞机俯瞰重庆时说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00053",
      "start_ms": 115490,
      "end_ms": 117190,
      "text": "此地并不适合人类居住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00054",
      "start_ms": 117250,
      "end_ms": 118795,
      "text": "因为没有平坦的陆地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00055",
      "start_ms": 119140,
      "end_ms": 122365,
      "text": "重庆的山地丘陵比例高达百分之九十三点六。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00056",
      "start_ms": 122700,
      "end_ms": 122940,
      "text": "然而，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00057",
      "start_ms": 122940,
      "end_ms": 126000,
      "text": "现在重庆却变成了世界人口最多的城市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00058",
      "start_ms": 126140,
      "end_ms": 128735,
      "text": "据说还是全国美女最多的城市。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00059",
      "start_ms": 129060,
      "end_ms": 130640,
      "text": "重庆人口三千两百多万，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00060",
      "start_ms": 130640,
      "end_ms": 133065,
      "text": "是我国唯一超三千万的超大城市。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00061",
      "start_ms": 133500,
      "end_ms": 134240,
      "text": "一九九七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00062",
      "start_ms": 134240,
      "end_ms": 136635,
      "text": "重庆成为了中国中西部唯一的直辖市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00063",
      "start_ms": 136850,
      "end_ms": 139045,
      "text": "是全中国最大、最年轻的直辖市。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00064",
      "start_ms": 139470,
      "end_ms": 140670,
      "text": "重庆到底有多强？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00065",
      "start_ms": 140790,
      "end_ms": 142155,
      "text": " Gdp全国第四，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00066",
      "start_ms": 142470,
      "end_ms": 144030,
      "text": "全国四十一个工业大类，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00067",
      "start_ms": 144130,
      "end_ms": 146720,
      "text": "重庆占了三十九个汽车产量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00068",
      "start_ms": 146760,
      "end_ms": 148680,
      "text": "摩托车产量都是全国第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00069",
      "start_ms": 148900,
      "end_ms": 152055,
      "text": "重庆还是全球最大的笔记本电脑生产基地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00070",
      "start_ms": 152450,
      "end_ms": 152830,
      "text": "如今，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00071",
      "start_ms": 152950,
      "end_ms": 154450,
      "text": "中国最反骨的城市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00072",
      "start_ms": 154450,
      "end_ms": 155615,
      "text": "重庆赶称第二，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00073",
      "start_ms": 155860,
      "end_ms": 156900,
      "text": "没人敢称第一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00074",
      "start_ms": 156980,
      "end_ms": 158985,
      "text": "你看这是重庆的波浪路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00075",
      "start_ms": 159330,
      "end_ms": 160430,
      "text": "这是重庆的一楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00076",
      "start_ms": 160710,
      "end_ms": 165235,
      "text": "实际上你是在二十二楼重庆市国际公认的基建天花板，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00077",
      "start_ms": 165530,
      "end_ms": 168245,
      "text": "八d魔幻立交楼里跑轻轨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00078",
      "start_ms": 168560,
      "end_ms": 172500,
      "text": "这里全国最深的地铁站红岩村站深埋一百一十六米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00079",
      "start_ms": 172580,
      "end_ms": 174025,
      "text": "堪比四十层高楼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00080",
      "start_ms": 174490,
      "end_ms": 176870,
      "text": "重庆是全中国桥梁最多的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00081",
      "start_ms": 176950,
      "end_ms": 179130,
      "text": "有各类桥梁一点四万多座，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00082",
      "start_ms": 179310,
      "end_ms": 181090,
      "text": "跨江特大桥一百零五座，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00083",
      "start_ms": 181210,
      "end_ms": 182315,
      "text": "数量全国第一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00084",
      "start_ms": 182560,
      "end_ms": 184200,
      "text": "重庆拥有五座机场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00085",
      "start_ms": 184320,
      "end_ms": 186524,
      "text": "是我国民航机场数量最多的城市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00086",
      "start_ms": 186890,
      "end_ms": 190285,
      "text": "这也是唯一一个国外比国内更火爆的城市。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00087",
      "start_ms": 190530,
      "end_ms": 191285,
      "text": "老外们都说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00088",
      "start_ms": 191520,
      "end_ms": 195065,
      "text": "重庆是人生必须打卡的赛博朋克之城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00089",
      "start_ms": 195410,
      "end_ms": 198795,
      "text": "我在重庆的机场发现外国人真的比中国人还要多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00090",
      "start_ms": 199120,
      "end_ms": 199820,
      "text": "你能想象吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00091",
      "start_ms": 199820,
      "end_ms": 200880,
      "text": "在一九三八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00092",
      "start_ms": 201020,
      "end_ms": 202600,
      "text": "韩国流亡政府到重庆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00093",
      "start_ms": 202620,
      "end_ms": 204165,
      "text": "建立了他们的临时首都，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00094",
      "start_ms": 204460,
      "end_ms": 207555,
      "text": "连韩国光复军的成立典礼都是在重庆举行的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00095",
      "start_ms": 207790,
      "end_ms": 212205,
      "text": "所以每一年清明节都会有大量的韩国人到重庆的名玉真墓来祭祖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00096",
      "start_ms": 212490,
      "end_ms": 213350,
      "text": "因为在历史上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00097",
      "start_ms": 213490,
      "end_ms": 215795,
      "text": "闵玉珍在重庆建立了大夏国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00098",
      "start_ms": 216060,
      "end_ms": 218080,
      "text": "后来大夏国归降于朱元璋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00099",
      "start_ms": 218280,
      "end_ms": 220860,
      "text": "而明玉珍那些后人则被贬到了高丽国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00100",
      "start_ms": 221000,
      "end_ms": 221640,
      "text": "也就是说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00101",
      "start_ms": 221760,
      "end_ms": 224855,
      "text": "现在很多韩国人其实都是明玉珍的后代。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00102",
      "start_ms": 225510,
      "end_ms": 228630,
      "text": "周军都知道韩国人吃不起的西瓜太贵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00103",
      "start_ms": 228910,
      "end_ms": 232665,
      "text": "但是我在重庆的西南大学遇见了一位九十七岁的老奶奶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00104",
      "start_ms": 232940,
      "end_ms": 234920,
      "text": "他让中国人实现了吃瓜自由。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00105",
      "start_ms": 235180,
      "end_ms": 239230,
      "text": "他培育出了八四二四麒麟瓜皇后、哈密瓜、绿宝石瓜等等，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00106",
      "start_ms": 239310,
      "end_ms": 241045,
      "text": "他就是无名著院士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00107",
      "start_ms": 241400,
      "end_ms": 242720,
      "text": "他是袁隆平的同学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00108",
      "start_ms": 242940,
      "end_ms": 244285,
      "text": "中国西瓜之母，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00109",
      "start_ms": 244500,
      "end_ms": 245920,
      "text": "但他却因为阿尔兹海默症，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00110",
      "start_ms": 246100,
      "end_ms": 247520,
      "text": "忘记了亲人的名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00111",
      "start_ms": 247600,
      "end_ms": 249715,
      "text": "忘记了自己一生伟大的贡献。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00112",
      "start_ms": 250110,
      "end_ms": 254445,
      "text": "这里是全中国最大的抗日空军阵亡将士实葬墓地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00113",
      "start_ms": 254810,
      "end_ms": 256990,
      "text": "他们是中国最壮烈的一群富二代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00114",
      "start_ms": 257130,
      "end_ms": 258970,
      "text": "诠是帅气的世家子弟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00115",
      "start_ms": 259090,
      "end_ms": 261810,
      "text": "牺牲时平均年龄仅仅二十三岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00116",
      "start_ms": 261970,
      "end_ms": 263545,
      "text": "一生最灿烂的年华。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00117",
      "start_ms": 263870,
      "end_ms": 265595,
      "text": "他们是中国第一代飞行员。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00118",
      "start_ms": 265880,
      "end_ms": 267180,
      "text": "从毕业到牺牲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00119",
      "start_ms": 267420,
      "end_ms": 268145,
      "text": "只有半年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00120",
      "start_ms": 268580,
      "end_ms": 272375,
      "text": "这里安眠着驾机撞上敌机同归于尽的陈怀民，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00121",
      "start_ms": 272800,
      "end_ms": 273575,
      "text": "放弃跳伞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00122",
      "start_ms": 273770,
      "end_ms": 276515,
      "text": "驾机直撞日寇军舰的沈崇慧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00123",
      "start_ms": 276850,
      "end_ms": 278870,
      "text": "连日本人都敬佩的闫海文。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00124",
      "start_ms": 279030,
      "end_ms": 279630,
      "text": "牺牲前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00125",
      "start_ms": 279630,
      "end_ms": 280345,
      "text": "他嘶吼着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00126",
      "start_ms": 280540,
      "end_ms": 282255,
      "text": "中国没有被俘空军。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00127",
      "start_ms": 282660,
      "end_ms": 283220,
      "text": "在重庆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00128",
      "start_ms": 283220,
      "end_ms": 285120,
      "text": "你可以看到一串很特殊的地名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00129",
      "start_ms": 285240,
      "end_ms": 289425,
      "text": "分别称之为四公里、五公里、七公里、八公里、九公里等等。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00130",
      "start_ms": 289840,
      "end_ms": 290980,
      "text": "当年抗战时期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00131",
      "start_ms": 291000,
      "end_ms": 292825,
      "text": "民国政府不得不内迁重庆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00132",
      "start_ms": 293080,
      "end_ms": 293340,
      "text": "后来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00133",
      "start_ms": 293340,
      "end_ms": 295020,
      "text": "日本宣布封锁中国沿海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00134",
      "start_ms": 295120,
      "end_ms": 297105,
      "text": "阻止一切圆华物资进入中国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00135",
      "start_ms": 297430,
      "end_ms": 299350,
      "text": "就在这生死存亡的关键时刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00136",
      "start_ms": 299350,
      "end_ms": 301365,
      "text": "当务之急必须修建一条。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00137",
      "start_ms": 301630,
      "end_ms": 304830,
      "text": "通往外界的公路以够大后方的军事补给，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00138",
      "start_ms": 304970,
      "end_ms": 307890,
      "text": "于是便开始修建滇缅公路物资。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00139",
      "start_ms": 307890,
      "end_ms": 309450,
      "text": "从滇缅运往昆明之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00140",
      "start_ms": 309450,
      "end_ms": 311470,
      "text": "过贵州二十四拐抵达贵阳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00141",
      "start_ms": 311570,
      "end_ms": 312970,
      "text": "再走川黔公路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00142",
      "start_ms": 313090,
      "end_ms": 315430,
      "text": "它的终点就是重庆的海棠新码头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00143",
      "start_ms": 315590,
      "end_ms": 317629,
      "text": "在源源不断的送往抗战前线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00144",
      "start_ms": 317970,
      "end_ms": 320930,
      "text": "九公里八公里、六公里三公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00145",
      "start_ms": 321030,
      "end_ms": 321950,
      "text": "不只是地名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00146",
      "start_ms": 322010,
      "end_ms": 324510,
      "text": "更是物资抵达终点的倒计时。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00147",
      "start_ms": 324890,
      "end_ms": 327630,
      "text": "朱军重庆是一座英雄的城市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00148",
      "start_ms": 327830,
      "end_ms": 330030,
      "text": "重庆人民是英雄的人民。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00149",
      "start_ms": 330290,
      "end_ms": 332860,
      "text": "我的爷爷当年在抗美援朝的战友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00150",
      "start_ms": 332900,
      "end_ms": 334840,
      "text": "邱少云就是重庆人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00151",
      "start_ms": 335020,
      "end_ms": 336220,
      "text": "在抗战烽火中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00152",
      "start_ms": 336300,
      "end_ms": 339220,
      "text": "中国一大批的文人学者逆行奔赴重庆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00153",
      "start_ms": 339500,
      "end_ms": 341660,
      "text": "老舍先生在这里创作四世同堂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00154",
      "start_ms": 341900,
      "end_ms": 345260,
      "text": "梁实修创作雅社小品矛盾在这里写下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00155",
      "start_ms": 345280,
      "end_ms": 351180,
      "text": "白杨李赞还有文理大师、顾玉秀、地质学家、李四光、国歌的词作者、田汉等等，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00156",
      "start_ms": 351340,
      "end_ms": 353560,
      "text": "都在重庆投身抗战文艺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00157",
      "start_ms": 353620,
      "end_ms": 355540,
      "text": "号召全民族抗日救亡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00158",
      "start_ms": 355900,
      "end_ms": 356260,
      "text": "当时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00159",
      "start_ms": 356260,
      "end_ms": 360580,
      "text": "全中国的政治、军事、经济、文化中心都搬到了重庆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00160",
      "start_ms": 360860,
      "end_ms": 361850,
      "text": "一座山城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00161",
      "start_ms": 361950,
      "end_ms": 364305,
      "text": "愣是成为了中国的诺亚方舟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00162",
      "start_ms": 364630,
      "end_ms": 365450,
      "text": "而今天的重庆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00163",
      "start_ms": 365450,
      "end_ms": 368205,
      "text": "更是一座把人文关怀做到极致的城市。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00164",
      "start_ms": 368560,
      "end_ms": 370725,
      "text": "重庆四号线连接着城区和郊区，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00165",
      "start_ms": 371100,
      "end_ms": 374265,
      "text": "每天清晨都有许多老人背着背篓进城卖菜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00166",
      "start_ms": 374620,
      "end_ms": 375540,
      "text": "曾经有网友建议，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00167",
      "start_ms": 375540,
      "end_ms": 377940,
      "text": "高峰时段应该禁止乘客携带背篓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00168",
      "start_ms": 378020,
      "end_ms": 378780,
      "text": "影响市容。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00169",
      "start_ms": 378920,
      "end_ms": 380795,
      "text": "但重庆官方霸气回应，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00170",
      "start_ms": 381180,
      "end_ms": 383040,
      "text": "我们的地铁容得下公文包，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00171",
      "start_ms": 383100,
      "end_ms": 384305,
      "text": "也容得下飞龙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00172",
      "start_ms": 384700,
      "end_ms": 386800,
      "text": "考虑到不少老人听不懂普通话这条线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00173",
      "start_ms": 386800,
      "end_ms": 388705,
      "text": "还特意增设了方言爆站。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00174",
      "start_ms": 389190,
      "end_ms": 390690,
      "text": "如今在重庆的长江上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00175",
      "start_ms": 390690,
      "end_ms": 391770,
      "text": "还有一条亏本了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00176",
      "start_ms": 391770,
      "end_ms": 392985,
      "text": "十几年的船只，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00177",
      "start_ms": 393380,
      "end_ms": 396025,
      "text": "乘客全是背着背篓的卖菜老人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00178",
      "start_ms": 396380,
      "end_ms": 397900,
      "text": "大多数老人不会使用微信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00179",
      "start_ms": 398020,
      "end_ms": 400705,
      "text": "还在保持着原始的手撕票据的方式。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00180",
      "start_ms": 401080,
      "end_ms": 402160,
      "text": "航线在长江上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00181",
      "start_ms": 402160,
      "end_ms": 403105,
      "text": "经过六个站点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00182",
      "start_ms": 403400,
      "end_ms": 404000,
      "text": "十多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00183",
      "start_ms": 404100,
      "end_ms": 404855,
      "text": "从未涨价，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00184",
      "start_ms": 405130,
      "end_ms": 406215,
      "text": "还有免费的早餐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00185",
      "start_ms": 406500,
      "end_ms": 408705,
      "text": "时代的发展并没有把他们落下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00186",
      "start_ms": 409160,
      "end_ms": 410380,
      "text": "周军在重庆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00187",
      "start_ms": 410380,
      "end_ms": 414325,
      "text": "我见过一座最令人泪目的博物馆、三峡水下博物馆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00188",
      "start_ms": 414650,
      "end_ms": 416395,
      "text": "这里收藏的不是冰冷的器物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00189",
      "start_ms": 416610,
      "end_ms": 419195,
      "text": "而是三峡人民再也回不去的故乡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00190",
      "start_ms": 419730,
      "end_ms": 423245,
      "text": "你见过这位在背上背了一整棵桃花树的男人吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00191",
      "start_ms": 423580,
      "end_ms": 424025,
      "text": "当年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00192",
      "start_ms": 424130,
      "end_ms": 426350,
      "text": "他被告知要立刻搬离故乡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00193",
      "start_ms": 426770,
      "end_ms": 428035,
      "text": "永远不可能再回来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00194",
      "start_ms": 428520,
      "end_ms": 429960,
      "text": "他搬走全部家当之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00195",
      "start_ms": 430060,
      "end_ms": 432080,
      "text": "驮起了一棵正在盛放的桃树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00196",
      "start_ms": 432260,
      "end_ms": 434525,
      "text": "最后一次带走故乡的春天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00197",
      "start_ms": 434910,
      "end_ms": 436590,
      "text": "而他的家乡不久之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00198",
      "start_ms": 436730,
      "end_ms": 438795,
      "text": "将被江水彻底吞没。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00199",
      "start_ms": 439310,
      "end_ms": 441230,
      "text": "这就是二十世纪最伟大的工程，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00200",
      "start_ms": 441230,
      "end_ms": 443565,
      "text": "背后一个平凡的不能再平凡的故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00201",
      "start_ms": 444180,
      "end_ms": 445040,
      "text": "二零零二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00202",
      "start_ms": 445040,
      "end_ms": 448060,
      "text": "感动中国人物把一座特别的奖杯颁给了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00203",
      "start_ms": 448060,
      "end_ms": 449040,
      "text": "一百三十多万。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00204",
      "start_ms": 449140,
      "end_ms": 451820,
      "text": "像他一样背着桃花树离乡的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00205",
      "start_ms": 451880,
      "end_ms": 455460,
      "text": "他们共同的身份叫三峡一民无数。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00206",
      "start_ms": 455560,
      "end_ms": 458575,
      "text": "重庆、湖北儿女离开了生于丝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00207",
      "start_ms": 458810,
      "end_ms": 459835,
      "text": "长于司的故土。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00208",
      "start_ms": 460260,
      "end_ms": 460820,
      "text": "而现在，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00209",
      "start_ms": 460900,
      "end_ms": 463540,
      "text": "全中国最敢花钱消费的城市在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00210",
      "start_ms": 463760,
      "end_ms": 465375,
      "text": "答案可能出乎你的意料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00211",
      "start_ms": 465660,
      "end_ms": 466560,
      "text": "不是北上广深，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00212",
      "start_ms": 466620,
      "end_ms": 468960,
      "text": "而是重庆二零二五年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00213",
      "start_ms": 468960,
      "end_ms": 470360,
      "text": "社会消费品零售数据，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00214",
      "start_ms": 470420,
      "end_ms": 471940,
      "text": "重庆直接干掉上海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00215",
      "start_ms": 472040,
      "end_ms": 473345,
      "text": "登顶全国第一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00216",
      "start_ms": 473620,
      "end_ms": 476175,
      "text": "重庆一年就要吃掉一百二十亿吨火锅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00217",
      "start_ms": 476490,
      "end_ms": 478815,
      "text": "每天要吃掉五百万碗小面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00218",
      "start_ms": 479270,
      "end_ms": 482090,
      "text": "如果说北上广深是中国经济的排头兵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00219",
      "start_ms": 482170,
      "end_ms": 485645,
      "text": "那么川渝地区就是中国城市的幸福样板。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00220",
      "start_ms": 486390,
      "end_ms": 491140,
      "text": "今天的重庆五a级景区有十二个有着世界自然遗产天坑地缝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00221",
      "start_ms": 491300,
      "end_ms": 493155,
      "text": "世界上著名的长江三峡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00222",
      "start_ms": 493500,
      "end_ms": 496595,
      "text": "世界上最大规模的磨牙石刻大足石刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00223",
      "start_ms": 496900,
      "end_ms": 498945,
      "text": "全球三大溶洞之一的芙蓉洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00224",
      "start_ms": 499190,
      "end_ms": 501865,
      "text": "还有现实版的千与千寻、洪崖洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00225",
      "start_ms": 502250,
      "end_ms": 505430,
      "text": "它又是世界温泉之都世界六大雾都之一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00226",
      "start_ms": 505550,
      "end_ms": 507805,
      "text": "更是世界上最宠粉的城市。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00227",
      "start_ms": 508260,
      "end_ms": 510600,
      "text": "尽管年平均雾日多达一百零四天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00228",
      "start_ms": 510760,
      "end_ms": 512075,
      "text": "但无数人都坦言，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00229",
      "start_ms": 512460,
      "end_ms": 513260,
      "text": "离开重庆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00230",
      "start_ms": 513340,
      "end_ms": 515380,
      "text": "就像一场猝不及防的失恋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00231",
      "start_ms": 515640,
      "end_ms": 516915,
      "text": "满心都是牵挂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00232",
      "start_ms": 517310,
      "end_ms": 519305,
      "text": "长江与嘉陵江再次交汇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00233",
      "start_ms": 519560,
      "end_ms": 522125,
      "text": "滋养出一座山水相依的魅力之城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00234",
      "start_ms": 522480,
      "end_ms": 524540,
      "text": "这里是红岩精神的孕育之地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00235",
      "start_ms": 524600,
      "end_ms": 526440,
      "text": "也是巴渝文化的发祥地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00236",
      "start_ms": 526680,
      "end_ms": 527700,
      "text": "每当夜幕降临，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00237",
      "start_ms": 527880,
      "end_ms": 529480,
      "text": "洪崖洞亮灯的瞬间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00238",
      "start_ms": 529660,
      "end_ms": 530765,
      "text": "灯火璀璨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00239",
      "start_ms": 531150,
      "end_ms": 533730,
      "text": "凤姐与巫山交界处的瞿塘峡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00240",
      "start_ms": 533850,
      "end_ms": 539100,
      "text": "是三峡中最短却最雄奇的一段两岸苍山被长江劈开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00241",
      "start_ms": 539240,
      "end_ms": 541125,
      "text": "形成天造地设的夔门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00242",
      "start_ms": 541430,
      "end_ms": 543690,
      "text": "这就是十元钱人民币背面的图案。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00243",
      "start_ms": 544050,
      "end_ms": 544830,
      "text": "三国时期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00244",
      "start_ms": 544930,
      "end_ms": 548250,
      "text": "刘备托孤诸葛亮的故事就发生在白帝城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00245",
      "start_ms": 548830,
      "end_ms": 550570,
      "text": "朝辞白帝彩云间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00246",
      "start_ms": 550750,
      "end_ms": 552250,
      "text": "千里江陵一日还。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00247",
      "start_ms": 552450,
      "end_ms": 553030,
      "text": "来重庆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00248",
      "start_ms": 553230,
      "end_ms": 554610,
      "text": "一定要现场感受一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00249",
      "start_ms": 554850,
      "end_ms": 556810,
      "text": "轻舟已过万重山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00250",
      "start_ms": 557130,
      "end_ms": 559370,
      "text": "感受大自然鬼斧神工的震撼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00251",
      "start_ms": 559730,
      "end_ms": 561290,
      "text": "而在重庆的大山深处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00252",
      "start_ms": 561450,
      "end_ms": 564330,
      "text": "还有一颗三千多岁的金丝楠木王。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00253",
      "start_ms": 564670,
      "end_ms": 565510,
      "text": "更神奇的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00254",
      "start_ms": 565550,
      "end_ms": 567210,
      "text": "他还是一颗雷击木，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00255",
      "start_ms": 567310,
      "end_ms": 568430,
      "text": "被大火烧之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00256",
      "start_ms": 568430,
      "end_ms": 569790,
      "text": "竟然枯木逢春，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00257",
      "start_ms": 569930,
      "end_ms": 572340,
      "text": "被当地村民称之为长生树。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00258",
      "start_ms": 572420,
      "end_ms": 574000,
      "text": "据说能够看上一眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00259",
      "start_ms": 574080,
      "end_ms": 575560,
      "text": "都是有福之人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00260",
      "start_ms": 575940,
      "end_ms": 576340,
      "text": "朱君，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00261",
      "start_ms": 576780,
      "end_ms": 577480,
      "text": "总有一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00262",
      "start_ms": 577620,
      "end_ms": 580160,
      "text": "你会来到心里一直惦记的魔幻山城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00263",
      "start_ms": 580220,
      "end_ms": 583160,
      "text": "重庆走在高低错落的梯坎路上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00264",
      "start_ms": 583320,
      "end_ms": 585740,
      "text": "吹着长江与嘉陵江交织的晚风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00265",
      "start_ms": 586120,
      "end_ms": 586940,
      "text": "看蜀之道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00266",
      "start_ms": 586940,
      "end_ms": 588000,
      "text": "立于群山之上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00267",
      "start_ms": 588120,
      "end_ms": 590280,
      "text": "看纵横交错的大桥立交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00268",
      "start_ms": 590480,
      "end_ms": 592740,
      "text": "看穿梭于西峰古道的棒棒君。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00269",
      "start_ms": 592940,
      "end_ms": 594460,
      "text": "重庆的重是重逢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00270",
      "start_ms": 594820,
      "end_ms": 598660,
      "text": "重庆的庆是庆幸诚邀诸君共赴山城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2f5c9fca5b6ca022_s00271",
      "start_ms": 598940,
      "end_ms": 603105,
      "text": "在江枫与烟火中读懂这座成的万千风情。"
    }
  ],
